{%- comment -%} The now line: what the café is serving, one line per state of the day (data-when), the "plain" one shown with no script. The script fills the empty slots with today's times. {%- endcomment -%}
<span data-when="plain">Open 7 to 3, Wednesday to Monday</span><span data-when="before">Opening today at <span data-slot="opens"></span></span><span data-when="breakfast">Serving breakfast till <span data-slot="until"></span></span><span data-when="lunch">Serving lunch till <span data-slot="until"></span></span><span data-when="coffee">Coffee and the bakery case till <span data-slot="until"></span></span><span data-when="after">Closed for the day · back <span data-slot="next_day"></span> at <span data-slot="next_opens"></span></span><span data-when="closed">Closed today · back <span data-slot="next_day"></span> at <span data-slot="next_opens"></span></span>
